00:08:38,181 --> 00:08:44,181
The Muppet Movie is a family, comedy, adventure film directed by James Frawley.

3
00:12:57,272 --> 00:13:03,272
The Muppets gather to watch their newly-finished big-budget rich-and-famous feature film: a talent
agent persuades Kermit the Frog to leave the swamp to pursue a career in Hollywood.

4
